gaqu(){return"Tap or swipe the correct lane when a note reaches the beat line. Well-timed hits build combos; bigger combos score more, and a perfect hit scores extra. Every hit fills the reel; a full reel gives +250 points and restores 1 life if you are missing one. A missed note or a tap on the wrong lane breaks the combo and costs a life; the run ends when all 3 lives are gone. Powers: BEAT FREEZE stops the notes for 8 sec, AUTO REEL hits automatically for 6 sec, SCORE X2 doubles points for 12 sec. Powers themselves never break combos or cost lives."},
