gauR(){return"Tap the bugs popping out of the holes to smash them. Every hit scores; the bigger your combo, the more each hit is worth. An escaped bug breaks your combo, every 3rd miss costs a life, and the run ends when all 3 lives are gone. Tapping an empty hole only breaks the combo and costs no life. Traps appear once your score passes 220: touching a trap counts as a miss, but letting it expire has no penalty. Powers: Double Slipper smashes one extra bug on your next hit, Golden Slipper doubles all points for 20 seconds, and Medicine clears every target on screen. You can end the run early with the FINISH button."},
