gPt(){return"Tap to make the bug jump; when you stop tapping, gravity pulls it down. You score only by passing through gates \u2014 the more you jump, the more each gate is worth. The first 15 seconds are slower, with wider gate gaps. Hitting a gate or resting on the ground too long ends the run. The microphone is optional: turn it on with the mic button to jump by shouting; if permission is denied, you can keep playing by tapping. Powers: Jump launches a mighty leap and forgives one gate hit, Shield saves you from death once, and Nitro speeds you up for 8 seconds and adds +25 points per gate. You can end the run early with the FINISH button."},
